abstract: Initial AI transcription of the 1874 hospital-report booklet catalogued
  as 醫館略述三書, Bodleian Sinica 1634. The frozen initial seal-title reads 三書 provisionally,
  while the catalog note and prior non-blind source observation suggest 二書; this conflict
  is not silently resolved. Printed era dating differs from the Serica era string.
  The 436 units include 434 original-print units and two modern descriptions of later
  marks. No independent reading is applied; no human double collation, expert review,
  peer review or measured accuracy is claimed. Historical-document digitization and
  publication only, without biological research or modern procedural guidance.
